'''Rebolt''' was a young [[human]] [[Gender|male]] criminal who worked for the notorious [[White Worms]] gang. He was part of the scrumrat portion of the gang<ref name="Official Guide" /> and at one point was considered for the role of [[Head]] Boy.<ref name="Most Wanted">''[[Most Wanted]]''</ref>

In [[13 BBY]], Rebolt and [[Syke]] dragged the [[scrumrat]] [[Han Solo|Han]] before the gang's leader [[Lady]] [[Proxima]] in the [[Den of the White Worms]]. Han had returned from a negotiation with nothing to show for it, but managed to escape the angered Proxima with his friend [[Qi'ra]] by distracting Proxima with light, which burned her skin. [[Moloch]], Syke and Rebolt chased Han in the gang's [[A-A4B truckspeeder|A-A4B landspeeder]] and eventually caught up with him in [[Coronet City Spaceport|Coronet Spaceport]]. They were only able to capture Qi'ra, as Han fled into an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] recruitment center.<ref name="Solo">''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]''</ref>

[[Standard decade|Decade]]s later, Rebolt was mentioned in the ''[[Galactic Explorer's Guide]]'', a survival guide written by [[Hondo Ohnaka]] and [[DK-RA-43]].<ref name="Galactic Explorer's Guide">''[[Star Wars: The Galactic Explorer's Guide]]''</ref>

